# COMPONENT

## TestSync

### PACKAGE

org.sample.testsync

### DESCRIPTION

CQRS-derived sample component for test/local synchronous command override.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates one command that stays async by default but can be
forced into a synchronous execution path for test or local verification.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

Two execution shapes are compared for the same command target:
1. Default command side (`Item` service): create an item through the job-backed command path.
2. Override path (`Item` service): run the same command synchronously for test/local/debug use.

### LIFECYCLE

Typical flow:
1. `createItem` with the default async/job-backed path
2. `createItem` again with runtime execution override

# SERVICE

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Item-facing command operations used to compare default and overridden execution.

### OPERATION

#### createItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates a new item through the command side.

##### IN

Item creation payload.

##### OUT

Default command job result.

# ENTITY

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Shared item entity used by the command target.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

# COMMAND

## CreateItem

### DESCRIPTION

Command to create an item.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | 1            |
| title | string | 1            |

# OPERATION

## createItem

### TYPE
COMMAND

### INPUT
CreateItem

### OUTPUT
CreateItemResult
